<title>CROATIA: Croatian Kreditna Banka boosts '96 profit 7.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatian Kreditna Banka boosts '96 profit 7.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for calendar 1996.</p>
<p>(Millions of kuna unless otherwise stated.)</p>
<p>					   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		     6.4	   6.1</p>
<p>    Aftertax profit		   5.6	   5.2</p>
<p>    Net interest income	    21.7	  19.2</p>
<p>    Operating income		 41.2	  42.3</p>
<p>    Operating costs		 (30.6)	(23.9)</p>
<p>    Risk provisions and adjust.  (2.3)	(11.2)</p>
<p>    Assets			    428.7	 338.4 NOTES --</p>
<p>Kreditna Banka was ranked 21st among Croatian banks in 1995 according to capital. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385 1 4557075</p>
</text>
